{"game": "alien-swarm", "language": "english", "appid": 630, "month": "2021-07", "window": 3, "start_date": 1626393600, "end_date": 1627084799, "month_true_total": 29, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-06 01:07:10 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "96231564", "author": {"steamid": "76561199069559493", "personaname": "Nari", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/AMBF8-HCSL/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 1608, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 363, "last_played": 1632248175, "avatar": "71f6aa0a3b2a2a5b85cbbe16754999031c3675c4"}, "language": "english", "review": "Left 4 Dead top down! Alien Swarm is fast-paced, alien-filled fun that demands cooperative gaming and delivers cleverly directed missions that stay challenging from beginning to the end. The upgrade systems serves as a motivator and the match making is quite good. Physics, sound and lighting convey a spooky atmosphere. Although there is only one campaign at release, Alien Swarm delivers more fun than most full-price games.", "timestamp_created": 1627037799, "timestamp_updated": 1627037799, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "96219968", "author": {"steamid": "76561199184347698", "personaname": "pb", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/frogtropical/", "num_games_owned": 19, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 1723, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 647, "last_played": 1627275822, "avatar": "1b48343da436daa23914a8be271c7290f1e86ca3"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game, while small, is a great game from Valve that's like a top down version of Left4Dead except with alien bugs. It runs on the Source engine and enables people to make their own maps which is a plus. I like how weapons are unlockable but the default weapons still can stand a good chance against enemies on higher difficulties. Overall, it's free and I can't think of a reason not to get it! Valve sure knows how to cater it's fans with free little gems like this game.", "timestamp_created": 1627015870, "timestamp_updated": 1627015870, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 8, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.617265582084655762", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "96215254", "author": {"steamid": "76561198839042833", "personaname": "Nifty", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198839042833/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 43, "playtime_forever": 2193, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2097, "last_played": 1788989798, "avatar": "4ccac6c775c0d7248b357f79c63ff951095db186"}, "language": "english", "review": "great game.", "timestamp_created": 1627007488, "timestamp_updated": 1627007488, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "96154327", "author": {"steamid": "76561198292238693", "personaname": "Shadow", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198292238693/", "num_games_owned": 305, "num_reviews": 147, "playtime_forever": 6837, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1154, "last_played": 1664959024, "avatar": "c293c28982636383df5d1a086ad95c20011158ac"}, "language":